Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）所以呢，III你想去见九十九游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）是的。那时候的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们输掉并不是因为快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是输给了九十九游马的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他为什么能进行那样的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的力量究竟是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想用自己的眼睛去确认那一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）可以哦，III。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你如果真想这么做的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去见他就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）有没有人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愿意和我决斗的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有没有啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐呐，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！那，你呢？喂，你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.11,0:01:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）真是的，游马你冷静一点啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你这么说啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片还没凑齐呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明今天预选赛就结束了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～得赶紧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.23,0:01:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等我啦，真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）冷静点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对决斗者来说决斗是必然的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不是说这种话的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂……喂！你没事吧？喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生什么事了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……被鲨鱼那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.75,0:02:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 鲨鱼竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 在干什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 等等！ 你这家伙 到底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是怎么了啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）我 只是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗嘉年华中战斗而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今驱使着我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有复仇与憎恨之心。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记住吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是我的敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.09,0:03:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要！ 我不让！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你无论如何都要过去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，跟我决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这里跟我一决胜负吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就亲手把你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打得落花流水！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，不要贸然跟他战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！你给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和鲨鱼要决斗了……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那场决斗中，No.的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留在了心中，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的心已被憎恨所浸染。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 你要怎么和他战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我看看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 大颚鲨！ 攻击我我我魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）大嘴鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧 锤头鲨！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小小的抵抗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 将墓地中 等级4以下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 1000以下的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降低对方怪兽攻击力 相同的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种攻击… 根本不算什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦… 那么这个 怎么样！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:07:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 变成等级3的 锤头鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大颚鲨 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 潜航母舰 航空鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 航空鲨的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己每有一张手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就造成400点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是3张。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧 空袭鱼雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再跟我扯上…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完…还没完呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我拿出更多真本事来 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不来的话 那我就从这边攻过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 隆隆隆巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊！？游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用隆隆隆巨人攻击的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能破坏他的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底在想什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(III)怎么回事？这场决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的决斗一直是以憎恨在战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我们的决斗有什么不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……你 为什么要进行这样的决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Ｖ）让III去真的好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Ｖ）九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有和我们不同的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见到他之后 III的心如果动摇了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）没关系的。III是个温柔的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}温柔？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:09:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 正因为如此III一定会回来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）那孩子就是那样的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.99,0:09:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击隆隆巨魔。黑枪刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了，隆隆巨魔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着，我用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气鲨直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧，大食者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要打这种白白送输的牌！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完……还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，放马过来……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我看看你更多的真本事！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，难道你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我根本不在乎什么输赢怎样都无所谓了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！你这家伙，很恨我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就把你的那份憎恨全都冲我砸过来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}动真格地揍过来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果这样能让你的憎恨消失那就够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着憎恨……带着复仇来决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这样子，开心吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明明唯独对决斗是最喜欢不过的家伙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是现在，连决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你都想一起去憎恨了不是吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的你，我……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想看到啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！你在干什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没……没办法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁让我肚子饿了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……你这男人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我不是说了没办法嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为它自己响起来了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）真是的，一点都不体贴。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说了，什么外卖啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）从鲨鱼心中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.的力量消失了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……你真是个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不干了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太蠢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，鲨鱼……。等等啊！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没干劲了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到你这种笨蛋之后。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨……笨蛋你听我说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个了断就在决赛上分晓吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛痛痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有～什么好决赛的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是输给鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之碎片全都会被抢走的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊…啊～是这样没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全忘光了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为了朋友着想做的事我不会否定。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果输了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡和我的命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差点就消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉…。我一时血冲上头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡的事真的忘得一干二净了～。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是和爸爸的约定对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对要成为决斗冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，可是啊…我觉得爸爸的话在刚才那种时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对会不惜身体去阻止的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以他一定会原谅你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的父亲……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个人就是游马的父亲……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）哎呀，你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……那个，我是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好意思，来人啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我决斗吧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，在干什么……呜哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，好厉害啊，好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是从阿兹特克遗迹出土的面具。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是两千年前的磨制石器。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边是赫梯人制作的铁箭头。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇……印加项链！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每一件都是了不起的东西啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最喜欢的卡也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿兹特克面具魔像？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.06,0:14:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用的这套叫做欧帕兹卡组。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧帕兹就是这个世界和异次元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相连的证据哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.77,0:15:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界里重叠着许多次元，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那里过来的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定就是欧帕兹。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爸爸一直在研究这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.87,0:15:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我老爸也是个冒险家。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里的东西全都是老爸的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个厉害的人呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯……算是吧。啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说 现在不是说这种事的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是因为你们 害得哈鲁特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特的事 真的非常抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我只能那么做…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 我是为了复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直以憎恨之力战斗至今。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 看到你的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想到或许存在着与那不同的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你能那样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了他人拼尽全力？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的力量 究竟是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的… 力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.37,0:16:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和我不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么能那样战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的力量…我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么难的事我哪懂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.11,0:16:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之就是一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一飞冲天哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，无论什么时候都不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不忘挑战的心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸就是这么教我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你爸爸…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）来，游马午饭做好了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个…姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）小鸟她们也一起来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～肚子饿了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.09,0:16:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，要说我开动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知…知道了啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 每次每次 你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～ 看起来好好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）来 那边的你 坐下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.10,0:17:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 好。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我开动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）我开动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜嘻哟！！决斗饭 太好吃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一碗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我开动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我开动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小步美）茶 茶 茶 泡好了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小步美）给 笨手笨脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是笨手笨脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了 笨手笨脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好烫！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都笨手笨脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你也别笑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马 吃饭时冷静点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话是这么说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.94,0:18:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点吃完 得去决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃饭的时候 禁止玩卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.59,0:18:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还给我啦 姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 真是的 还给我啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都说了不行了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}III：对了 你看你看 哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿兹特克·面具·魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是父亲大人给我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（IV）太狡猾了 就你有 给我拿来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么这样。哥哥 还给我啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 真是的哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来这边呀 嘿嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明是我收到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Ｖ）住手 你们两个。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等爸爸回来了会被骂的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 知道了啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥 还给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次我就教你决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还差一点就集齐5张了呢～。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 我真的绝对要集齐！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的能成为决斗冠军吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《是啊 我的家人也以前也是这样…》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起，失礼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，III！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，III！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马看了你的家人，我全明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.71,0:20:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的力量……你的一飞冲天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了守护家人和同伴的笑容。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的家人和你们不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了复仇从发誓战斗的那一刻起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.05,0:20:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们家人的笑容就消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，只要复仇结束
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们一定会重新找回笑容。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，游马只要有你在，复仇就无法完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.47,0:20:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，为了我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须打倒你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊，为什么会变成这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特的事也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我们家族的意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我除了憎恨之外没有其他感情！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天傍晚，在那里等着。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是，地图吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和我来一场决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}III……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你回来啦，III。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆，我……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.70,0:21:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都不用说。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想要力量对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了战胜他的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，他很强。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的打算去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。　但是我还是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想和那家伙多说说话。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想知道那家伙真正的心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.06,0:22:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我要　和那家伙决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次　要介绍的怪兽是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弦魔人　嗡嗡节奏！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和怪兽超量战斗的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.86,0:24:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力可以变成２倍哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都怪嗡嗡节奏　搞得我也痒痒起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个事件　真是超难搞啊　华生。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.70,0:24:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是福尔摩斯啦！

